4 rows selected.
$T0> SELECT /*+ FULL SCAN(NGM_QRY_STATS) */ P, K, V
      FROM NGM_QRY_STATS WHERE K >= 'K-105' ORDER BY K;
P           K                                 V           
--------------------------------------------------------------
